ow we can sort of  blend what i would say are our good  classical liberal traditions  with true conservative principles i  think we can actually stem some of the  onslaught that is coming  you know five or six years ago when i  considered myself on the left and i  started saying you know guys we liberals  why are we shouting down all the  speakers why are we calling everyone  racist why are we calling everyone  homophobes this can't be this this  doesn't make sense we're not defending  our own principles we're not defending  free speech all this stuff a lot of the  pushback that i would get and there was  plenty of it was oh dave you know this  is just on college campuses don't worry  it's just a bunch of blue haired college  kids and they're not going to do  anything and the line that i would  always hear of course was you know when  they hit the real world when they hit  the real world then they'll figure out  what's what and i think if we've seen  anything in these last five years it's  that the real world folded pretty  quickly pretty freaking quickly and it's  on all of us and i would include myself  in that we did  something wrong i think something  happened  uh and i think perhaps  it's we're watching the end of the  liberal order that  just freedom for the sake of freedom  with nothing else behind it and nothing  eternal it does not work you end up  indoctrinating your own children to not  know what gender they are and then you  push racism into the system in the name  of anti-racism we all know something is  not right everyone knows it and we have  to do a better job defending it so that  really is why i'm so  proud to be here and i i think you know  the next part for all of us will be  not just talking about these things but  figuring out how we're going to  incorporate them into our lives to fight  back  so you know we did my tech company  locals we just merged with rumble this  week as i'm sure many of you heard and i  think this is one of the moments that we  will remember as a moment that we fought  against big tech because it's not just  college professors we're fighting and  it's not just democratic politicians and  it's not just brian stelter and don  lemon i wish we had a better class of  enemies sometimes  but it's not just these people it is now  fueled by big tech algorithms that are  that are silencing us and de-platforming  us and making sure that you know they  they uh what do they do they de-rank  things and they unbiased search results  they're doing all sorts of things and as  i often say on the show  it's not the ways that they're  manipulating us that we know about that  i'm really worried about it's the ways  that they're manipulating us that we  have no idea and i assure you they exist  so the move that we made this week was  to strengthen the fight and and i say  that not as self-promotion for locals or  rumble but i say that as something that  every one of us every one of you in this  room and everyone you're going to talk  to outside of this your family members  the people you work with we have to stop  participating in the lie we are we are  really  close to that final precipice like it  will all just go away  you know it doesn't matter what you  think about vaccines per se  it doesn't matter what you think about  trans issues it really doesn't what this  is all coming down to is will you be  able to exist on planet earth in a  western society with some level of  choice for yourself  and a lot of people are just kind of  saying no they can inject my child with  whatever they want they can tell me what  to do they can tell me to stay home they  can keep me in a mask forever and we're  watching it happen and and now you can  sort of see you know we live in this  weird time where everybody's everybody's  called a nazi right all of us i'm sure  everyone in this room has been called a  nazi they've butchered language in such  a  profoundly horrific way but i think  something that we now also see in these  last couple years is not just that the  world folded  as quickly as it did and the  institutions that were supposed to  defend us decided to get in on the  madness  it's not just that it's that you can now  sort of see how the nazis came to power  right we can all sort of see it i don't  think i could see it four years ago but  now you can kind of see it because we're  othering people oh those people not only  are they racist but now they're diseased  and they're going to kill you and the  rest of it so we are finding something  truly extraordinary but i will say this  because every day on my show i i you  know i cover the news and i try not to  have people depressed at the end there's  enough channels on where you can be  depressed or angry or you know you gotta  drink through them or whatever it is  and i  truly truly believe we can turn this  thing around  we really can but it's gonna take work  it's gonna be what i said before about  we have to stop participating in the lie  whatever that means in your own life to  just stop and start fighting back  whatever that means to you  and then it's to build new things so  we're already doing that on the tech  side and then more than more than  anything else especially if you're  someone that attends a conference like  this  start telling people what you think  start telling people what you think i  have no doubt that every single person  in this room is involved in many  relationships that your friends don't  know what you really think about the  world that your family members don't  know what you think about politics and i  don't mean that because politics should  be religion politics should not be  religion but people that are in your  circle should know what you think and  the more that we sit there quietly and  acquiesce to their madness the more they  will take they will take and it will be  on all of us so we'll do this conference  next year and things will be worse  so my job  as  i understand it is to communicate some  of these ideas to you guys and then my  hope is that your job is to take that  into your life and do something with it  so i'm very excited about the next few  days uh i'm honored to be part of this  and i hope everyone enjoys the  conference and oh  let's go brandon  if you're looking for more honest and  thoughtful conversations about politics  instead of non-stop yelling check out  our politics playlist and if you want to  watch full interviews on a variety of  topics watch our full episode playlist  all right over here and to get notified  of all future videos be sure to  subscribe and click the notification  bell

